Z||000000||FieroSTETZ||06-25-2000||03:39 AM||||well, i got to thinking about a forced induction system i had seen on an old vw bug, and i cam up with an idea. i got to measuring around inside my gt's front "area" and figured that i could cut 1 or 2 holes in the "trunk" wall, and run dryer ducting from there to somewhere else, effectively giving the air trapped behind the radiator a way out. i drew a junky (VERY) diagram of what i mean... if someone could maybe make the pic post right? (the yellow is the air)http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/airflow.jpg<BR>anyone think this would help cool at all? if so, i will do it, and make sure to post pics (if anyone is interested)||||reg||1
